    "de",
    "en",
    "Today's digital experiences are crucial to tomorrow's success - those who deliver emotion win. diva-e Conclusion is your partner for the holistic digitalization of your business processes and guides you along the path of transformation - from the first step to smooth operation. With extensive full-service expertise, diva-e Conclusion covers the entire digital value chain and, together with Conclusion, forms Europe’s powerhouse for Digital Experience and Business Transformation, focusing on B2B Manufacturing, Automotive, Retail, Pharma and Financial Services. This partnership offers our clients a Europe-wide network of over 4,000 digital experts dedicated to helping you create a seamless customer experience across all channels. We put the passion in transaction!",
    "The digitalization of business models and internal processes is a key factor in all industries today, and there is no one-size-fits-all solution.",
    "We at diva-e Conclusion know: Every company is unique. That's why we tailor our services to your individual requirements and deliver all the tools you need for digital success from a single source: strategy development, system integration, application management, hosting, data intelligence, digital marketing and long-term optimization.We create digital opportunities. For today and tomorrow.",
    "We call it Total Experience. You’ll call it smooth digital processes from start to finish. And your target audience will think: “Wow, it’s never been this easy.” Connecting talent, teamwork, and technology to bring your business ambition to life.",
    "We bring digital and marketing strategies to life! In times of digital change, we ensure that you are always one step ahead of your dynamic market environment. Our customized strategies are your key to a successful digital transformation. As your digital partner, we are at your side with help and advice and bring your goals from theory to practice. Let's get started together to take your business to a new level!",
    "With solutions developed in-house or in strategic partnerships with international market leaders: our diva-e Conclusion specialists in the field of digital experience platforms support you throughout the entire project - from start to finish. We analyze your existing system landscape, develop tailor-made applications and network your systems so that they interlock perfectly. In short: we make complex processes simple and efficient - for a digital experience that inspires.",
    "We support you in increasing your online presence with our performance marketing campaigns. We make you highly visible on all major marketing channels such as Google, Bing, Amazon and other platforms. Our approach? A holistic approach! We measure, analyze and optimize your online marketing. And best of all, we offer you intelligent tools that increase your efficiency and transactions through automation. In short: together we will put your marketing in the fast lane!",
    "Discover your opportunities with our Application Management Unit! We don't just see ourselves as consultants: we are partners on the way to your business goals. Together, we evaluate individually tailored technology solutions and show you how you can derive concrete benefits from them. We want to open up new digital horizons for you in order to sustainably advance your business.",
    "Development of the ZEISS VISUSTORE digital B2B platform to enable more self-service and more efficient ordering processes",
    "Mr.",
    "Ms.",
    "Mx.",
